{"title": "Spell Sniper", "pageid": 21500, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Spell_Sniper", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Spell_Sniper.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Spell_Sniper.webp/300px-Spell_Sniper.webp, /w/images/9/95/Spell_Sniper.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Spell_Sniper.webp/300px-Spell_Sniper.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/95/Spell_Sniper.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Spell Sniper</b> is a passive feature obtainable by a <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a> of the same name. Users with this feature have learned an additional cantrip, and are more likely to critical hit with a spell.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You learn a cantrip, and the number you need to roll a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> while attacking with a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">Spell</a> is reduced by 1. This effect can stack. \n</p><p>The cantrip must be one of:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bone_Chill\" title=\"Bone Chill\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Bone_Chill_Icon.webp/25px-Bone_Chill_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Bone_Chill_Icon.webp/38px-Bone_Chill_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Bone_Chill_Icon.webp/50px-Bone_Chill_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bone Chill\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Bone_Chill_Icon.webp/25px-Bone_Chill_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Bone_Chill_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bone_Chill\" title=\"Bone Chill\">Bone Chill</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Blast\" title=\"Eldritch Blast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp/25px-Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp/38px-Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp/50px-Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eldritch Blast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp/25px-Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/db/Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Blast\" title=\"Eldritch Blast\">Eldritch Blast</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Bolt\" title=\"Fire Bolt\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp/25px-Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/23/Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp/38px-Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/23/Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp/50px-Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire Bolt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp/25px-Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/23/Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Bolt\" title=\"Fire Bolt\">Fire Bolt</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ray_of_Frost\" title=\"Ray of Frost\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Ray_of_Frost_Icon.webp/25px-Ray_of_Frost_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Ray_of_Frost_Icon.webp/38px-Ray_of_Frost_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Ray_of_Frost_Icon.webp/50px-Ray_of_Frost_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ray of Frost\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Ray_of_Frost_Icon.webp/25px-Ray_of_Frost_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f9/Ray_of_Frost_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ray_of_Frost\" title=\"Ray of Frost\">Ray of Frost</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Grasp\" title=\"Shocking Grasp\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp/25px-Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp/38px-Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp/50px-Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shocking Grasp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp/25px-Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Shocking_Grasp_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Grasp\" title=\"Shocking Grasp\">Shocking Grasp</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thorn_Whip\" title=\"Thorn Whip\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/25px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/38px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/50px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thorn Whip\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/25px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thorn_Whip\" title=\"Thorn Whip\">Thorn Whip</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Sniper_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Sniper (Feat)\">Spell Sniper (Feat)</a>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ellice\" title=\"Ellice\">Ellice</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Elminster\" title=\"Elminster\">Elminster</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ghislev\" title=\"Ghislev\">Ghislev</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Grice\" title=\"Grice\">Grice</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Grimlark\" title=\"Grimlark\">Grimlark</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hivune\" title=\"Hivune\">Hivune</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Horriss\" title=\"Horriss\">Horriss</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Notar_Esojac\" title=\"Notar Esojac\">Notar Esojac</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The critical hit roll bonus applies to <i>all</i> spells with a spell attack roll.\n<ul><li>Spells like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Booming_Blade\" title=\"Booming Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/25px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/38px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/50px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Booming Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/25px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Booming_Blade\" title=\"Booming Blade\">Booming Blade</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Searing_Smite\" title=\"Searing Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/25px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/38px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/50px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Searing Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/25px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Searing_Smite\" title=\"Searing Smite\">Searing Smite</a> which make weapon attack rolls do not benefit.</li></ul></li>\n<li>These cantrips <b>do</b> scale with character level. So a Level 5 Fighter with Spell Sniper will send two rays with Eldritch Blast, or roll two damage dice for Ray of Frost.</li>\n<li>These cantrips use the character's <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spellcasting_Ability_and_Proficiency\" title=\"Spells\">Spellcasting Ability</a> for the class selected when gaining this feat. For example, if a <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">Cleric</a> class level is selected when gaining this feat and the character chooses Eldritch Blast with this feat, their <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> modifier is used, not their <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> modifier.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195722\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2189/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 15531/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9343/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 514/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 856518/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.779      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   38.779      1 -total\n 52.12%   20.212      8 Template:SAI\n 48.74%   18.900      8 Template:Icon_link\n 46.76%   18.133      8 Template:Icon_text\n 38.32%   14.860     16 Template:Trim\n 22.77%    8.830      8 Template:Ifempty\n 10.58%    4.102      1 Template:PageSeo\n  9.82%    3.807      1 Template:Hidden_code\n  8.27%    3.206      8 Template:Icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:21500-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195722 and revision id 387535. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}